uction sites.<br> 2.High floor means less noise and dust. Balcony offers views of the Marina, sea/gulf, Ain Dubai (Bluewaters), and partial Palm Jumeirah. Fireworks and drone shows are visible during holidays.<br> 3.Fully furnished, including small essentials such as a hair dryer, iron, drying rack, dishes, bed linen, and towels.<br> 4.Bedroom features a premium IKEA spring mattress (180 cm) for maximum comfort.<br> 5.Living room sofa (IKEA Vimle) converts into a bed for guests; includes a 65” TV.<br> 6.Fully equipped kitchen with dishwasher, coffee machine, toaster, and a washer with drying function.<br> 7.Spacious kitchen, rooms, and bathroom. Total area 952 sq.ft with a large balcony accessible from both rooms.<br> 8.Direct access to Marina Walk; steps to Carrefour, minutes to Spinneys, cafés, and restaurants.<br> 9.Chiller free – A/C included in service charges, keeping utilities affordable.<br> 10.Building amenities include a 25m swimming pool, gym, jacuzzi, sauna, and hammam.<br> 11.Additional facilities: cinema room, games room, lounge with café, and kids’ room.<br> 12.Easy access with minimal traffic; Sheikh Zayed Road is two traffic lights away.<br> 13.Excellent public transport: 12-minute walk to Sobha Realty Metro, nearby bus stop, and 7 minutes to the tram.<br> 14.Marriott Hotel opposite the building ensures easy taxi availability.<br> 15.Privilee users can walk to nearby beach resorts and leisure facilities.<br> Good sound insulation – minimal noise from neighbors.<br> <br> The apartment is available for long-term lease only, with official contract, EJARI, and cheques.","longitude":55.1352524,"negotiator_id":"11104","negotiator_mapping":"m.elshahed@providentestate.com","parking":["1"],"price":140000,"price_qualifier":null,"publish":1,"search_type":"lettings","slug":"1-bedroom-apartment-to-rent-in-damac-heights-dubai-marina-dubai","status":"To Let","thumbnail":"http://provident-bx-upload-eu.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/iblock/460/4602792fa81fc09aea4b4b4